{"id":885456,"title":"开篇介绍","content":"RAG系统通过检索增强生成来解决大模型行业知识不足和上下文长度限制问题。为了优化RAG，首先需要统一多源文档格式，以便更好地整合和检索数据。RAG的优化可以从架构和技术点入手，如引入专用向量数据库、模块化设计以及知识图谱等，以提高检索效果和排序准确性。此外，还可以在用户提问阶段进行意图判断和问题转述，确保问题完整性和准确性。从文档处理到信息抽取，再到最终生成答案，每个环节都需要优化。具体实现时，可以利用开源框架如Dify、QAnything或开发框架如LlamaIndex、LangChain，结合理论与实践，逐步构建高效的RAG系统。","comments":[{"had_liked":false,"id":401001,"user_name":"轩爷","can_delete":false,"product_type":"c3","uid":1016658,"ip_address":"北京","ucode":"1C59F6A4E7ABAE","user_header":"https://static001.geekbang.org/account/avatar/00/0f/83/52/d67f276d.jpg","comment_is_top":true,"comment_ctime":1750292607,"is_pvip":false,"replies":null,"discussion_count":0,"race_medal":0,"score":2,"product_id":101054401,"comment_content":"老师可以把 PPT 放出来，谢谢","like_count":5},{"had_liked":false,"id":401674,"user_name":"Geek_17e98c","can_delete":false,"product_type":"c3","uid":3867811,"ip_address":"上海","ucode":"28B2C918142347","user_header":"","comment_is_top":false,"comment_ctime":1753258385,"is_pvip":false,"replies":null,"discussion_count":0,"race_medal":0,"score":2,"product_id":101054401,"comment_content":"哈哈学习了好几门老师的视频课。老师的课讲得挺好的，通俗易懂。就是从最早的python小鲜肉老师到现在美颜（为啥要加口红），有点点不习惯","like_count":1},{"had_liked":false,"id":401220,"user_name":"亚林","can_delete":false,"product_type":"c3","uid":1018972,"ip_address":"湖南","ucode":"4A5A6D24314B79","user_header":"https://static001.geekbang.org/account/avatar/00/0f/8c/5c/3f164f66.jpg","comment_is_top":false,"comment_ctime":1751277148,"is_pvip":false,"replies":null,"discussion_count":0,"race_medal":0,"score":2,"product_id":101054401,"comment_content":"这一次尹老师思路，对RAG理解有加深了一层，谢谢","like_count":1},{"had_liked":false,"id":406637,"user_name":"在路上","can_delete":false,"product_type":"c3","uid":1619588,"ip_address":"上海","ucode":"C11D567FCB8CD6","user_header":"https://static001.geekbang.org/account/avatar/00/18/b6/84/1f60f267.jpg","comment_is_top":false,"comment_ctime":1775522868,"is_pvip":false,"replies":null,"discussion_count":0,"race_medal":0,"score":2,"product_id":101054